    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🛠️ Setup Guide  \n*Author: [Nate Herk](https://www.youtube.com/@nateherk)*\n\nFollow these steps to get your [Blotato](https://blotato.com/?ref=nate) integration up and running in n8n:\n\n### ✅ Step 1: Create a [Blotato](https://blotato.com/?ref=nate) Account  \nGo to [Blotato](https://blotato.com/?ref=nate) and create an account.  \nUse **code:** `NATE30` for **30% off for six months**.\n\n### 🔐 Step 2: Add Your API Key  \nAfter setting up your [Blotato](https://blotato.com/?ref=nate) account, copy your **Blotato API key**  \nand create a new credential in the Blotato nodes.\n\n### 🔗 Step 3: Connect Social Accounts  \nLog in to the social accounts you want to use with [Blotato](https://blotato.com/?ref=nate).  \n\n### 📄 Step 4: Set Up Your Google Sheet  \n1. Download the [Google Sheet Template](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1csPrRbHBbudiI4Gty5lDC6XAn8MabVcv1F-HDvJvx8M/copy)  \n2. Make a **copy** of it to your own Google Drive  \n3. Begin filling in your media content for **automated posting**\n\n---\nIf you're having issues with a platform, check out the platform requirements documentation [here](https://help.blotato.com/tips-and-tricks/social-platform-requirements#general-guidelines)\n\nYou're all set! 🎉 Let the automation begin.\n",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
